om2
note a for inside an if hoists 10001; the if's close restores hz_n (bhz), so the use after the if
note loads 10001 itself. With no arguments the if is not taken and x20 was never loaded: exits 1
fn main to int
s = ulong 0
if gt argcnt 5
for i ulong 4
s = add s 10001
end
end
s = add s 10001
ret int sub s 10000
end
